## uic-open-limit: open_limit.rs (the question before a big file opens)

# { $size } is the size of the file in MB, { $memory } the memory that it needs, in GB.
uic-open-limit-ask = This file is { $size } MB and needs about { $memory } GB of memory to open. Open it?
# { $installed } is the memory of this computer, in GB.
uic-open-limit-refuse = This file is { $size } MB and needs about { $memory } GB of memory to open, but this computer has only { $installed } GB. Kadakas cannot open it here.
